    <div style="font-size:1.1rem; font-weight:700; color:#0f172a; margin-bottom:8px;">Like what you see?</div>
    <div style="font-size:0.85rem; color:#475569; margin-bottom:20px; line-height:1.6;">Get your own branded version in 2 minutes. Add your logo, bank details, and start billing today.</div>
