      <a href="https://billingstudio.pcmcdiary.com" target="_blank" style="background:#1e3a5f; color:#fff; padding:13px 28px; border-radius:50px; font-size:0.85rem; font-weight:700; text-decoration:none;">Get Full Version &rarr;</a>
